[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524009587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524009587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100108","id":2524009587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcVRz","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T19:29:02Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T19:29:02Z","body":"Well, this is the case `force_fixed_history()` was added for. You start action with a global object and then provide a Shortcut instance which is recognized as local (due to empty path).\n\nThe context is useful when you have a local action (i.e. on scene), which starts with global object. We use this e.g. in SceneTreeDock, where EditorSelection is often involved.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/editor/scene_tree_dock.cpp#L749\nOpposite operations are not supported. If you have undo/redo action in global history, it can't operate on objects from the scene, which is what the error warns about. If the error was removed, there is a risk of undiscovered cases of wrong history usage. Hence in the case where history can't be determined correctly (which is only when creating new non-built-in Resource I think?) you have to explicitly \"disable\" the error.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524009587/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524020273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524020273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100108","id":2524020273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcX4x","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T19:36:02Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T19:36:02Z","body":"Am I correct in the following understanding?\n\nThe correct way to write this code would be:\n\n``` GDScript\nfunc undo_redo_test_action() -> void:\n\tvar sc: Shortcut = Shortcut.new()\n\n\tvar undo_redo: EditorUndoRedoManager = get_undo_redo()\n\tundo_redo.create_action(\"performed test action\", UndoRedo.MERGE_DISABLE, ProjectSettings)\n\tundo_redo.force_fixed_history()\n\tundo_redo.add_do_property(sc, \"events\", [])\n\tundo_redo.add_undo_property(sc, \"events\", [])\n\tundo_redo.commit_action()\n```\n\nAnd the only issue that exists is mistakes in the documentation for `EditorUndoRedoManager`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524020273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524067106","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524067106","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100108","id":2524067106,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcjUi","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:06:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:06:28Z","body":"You need to force history before every operation:\n```GDScript\nundo_redo.force_fixed_history()\nundo_redo.add_do_property(sc, \"events\", [])\nundo_redo.force_fixed_history()\nundo_redo.add_undo_property(sc, \"events\", [])\n```\nMaybe this could be changed; once per whole action should be enough.\nThe method was added recently and covers a rare corner case. It's used only in 2 places in the whole codebase.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524067106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524070893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524070893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100108","id":2524070893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WckPt","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:08:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:09:15Z","body":"> You need to force history before every operation:\n\nHmm, `EditorUndoRedoManager::commit_action` is the only place where `forced_history` is reset to `false`, so as it stands, you only need to do it once per action, like in [my example](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524020273).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524070893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524082676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100108#issuecomment-2524082676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100108","id":2524082676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WcnH0","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T20:17:11Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T20:17:11Z","body":"Then the description of this method is wrong.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"